### DevNest API — Request Collection
### Use with VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) or JetBrains' built-in HTTP client.
### Click "Send Request" above any request block below. No Postman needed.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Variables you'll fill in as you test — update these after each relevant request.
### Tip: after a login/register response comes back, copy the token/id into these lines.
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI3NzEzMWQ4ZC1hYzk0LTRjNDMtODc2Yy04Mjc0NzQ2NjM4MGUiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODYxNzUyNDksImV4cCI6MTc4ODc2NzI0OX0.7dIOljpbTQrWFm-t8gENMKz3gdN5dewpLFNhtIs_dUo
@userId = 77131d8d-ac94-4c43-876c-82747466380e
@otherUserId = 0ba5faae-9ba5-46f0-921e-f9a536890c51
@projectId = c79154f9-58af-4b44-8b2b-9cf36a32c274
